OL,3,GNEWSAFire-gutted pub could be bought by
OL,4,Acouncil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire-ravaged pub could be bought by a
OL,7,Fcouncil for #200,000 after sitting
OL,8,Fempty on the high street for five
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FStratford-on-Avon District Council is
OL,12,Fin talks with the owner of the Grade
OL,13,FII-listed Three Tuns in Alcester,
OL,14,FWarwickshire, over its possible
OL,15,Fpurchase.
OL,17,FThe building on High Street was badly
OL,18,Fdamaged by a fire in 2021, which caused
OL,19,Fmuch of its roof to collapse.
OL,20,FScaffolding has been in place ever
OL,21,Fsince, obstructing the pavement.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
